    "**7)** En reprenant l'esprit de la dernière question sur le TP 3 de Crank-Nicolson et Heun, tracer les courbes de convergence pour les 4 méthodes (Euler explicite, Euler implicite, Crank-Nicolson et Heun) pour le problème de l'oscillateur harmonique étudié dans ce TP.  \n",
    "Qu'observez-vous ?\n",
    "\n",
    "*Remarque importante* : Dans le cas d'un problème d'ordre 2 ici, le calcul des erreurs se fera en utilisant la formule suivante :\n",
    "\n",
    "$$ err = \\vert x_{num}(n \\Delta t) - x_{ex}(n \\Delta t) \\vert + \\vert v_{num}(n \\Delta t) - v_{ex}(n \\Delta t) \\vert $$\n",
    "\n",
    "où $x$ et $v$ sont les deux composantes du vecteur $U$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 178,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Question 7 : Courbes de convergence des 4 méthodes\n",
    "nb_sim = 8\n",
    "errEE = np.zeros(nb_sim)\n",
    "errEI = np.zeros(nb_sim)\n",
    "errCN = np.zeros(nb_sim)\n",
    "errH = np.zeros(nb_sim)\n",
    "ite = np.zeros(nb_sim)\n",
    "\n",
    "for k in range(nb_sim) :\n",
    "    param = Param()\n",
    "    param.T = 3.\n",
    "    param.n = 10 * 2**k\n",
    "    param.dt = param.T / param.n\n",
    "\n",
    "    init_linear(param)\n",
    "    tabtemps(param)\n",
    "    calcul_solution_exacte(param)\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Euler Explicite\n",
    "    euler_explicite(param)\n",
    "    errEE[k] = np.max(np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,0] - param.solution_approchee[:,0])\n",
    "                     + np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,1] - param.solution_approchee[:,1]))\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Euler Implicite\n",
    "    euler_implicite(param)\n",
    "    errEI[k] = np.max(np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,0] - param.solution_approchee[:,0])\n",
    "                     + np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,1] - param.solution_approchee[:,1]))\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Crank-Nicolson\n",
    "    crank_nicolson(param)\n",
    "    errCN[k] = np.max(np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,0] - param.solution_approchee[:,0])\n",
    "                     + np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,1] - param.solution_approchee[:,1]))\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Heun\n",
    "    heun(param)\n",
    "    errH[k] = np.max(np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,0] - param.solution_approchee[:,0])\n",
    "                    + np.abs(param.solution_exacte[:,1] - param.solution_approchee[:,1]))\n",
    "\n",
    "    ite[k] = param.n\n",
    "\n",
    "PlotConv4c(ite, errEE, errEI, errCN, errH)"
